misuse_note: a small p on the *selected* best trial is not evidence of a real edge; you already searched 100 rules (multiple testing / backtest overfitting — see AFML, López de Prado 2018).
iid_note: financial returns often violate IID (volatility clustering); IID-based p-values then overstate significance.
seed7_note: under the null ~4.55 hits/100 are expected; seed 7 is an extreme draw that produced 10.

